 - Initial specification suite (`PROJECT.md`, `docs/SPEC-*.md`, `docs/COMPARISON-*.md`), MADR 4.0 decisions (`ADR-0001`–`ADR-0006`), Storypole backlog (`RM-1`–`RM-22`), and Gaugeblock suite workflow configuration (`RM-1`).
